# immudb connection configuration for the secure-software-supply-chain pipeline.
#
# This file holds the connection values for the immudb server only. It is NOT a
# DB driver config (Go's immudb client reads these values via client.Options
# before opening a session). It is safe to commit the TEMPLATE (.env.example);
# keep the real values in .env and do NOT commit the actual .env to git.
#
# The immudb Go SDK (github.com/codenotary/immudb) reads these through
# client.Options (Address, Port, Auth, Username, Password, CurrentDatabase)
# and calls OpenSession() for auth + DB selection in one gRPC call.

# immudb server gRPC address and port
IMMUDB_ADDR=127.0.0.1
IMMUDB_PORT=3322

# immudb server credentials (default for the immudb container image)
IMMUDB_USER=immudb
IMMUDB_PASSWORD=immudb

# Target immudb database (securesoftwaresupplychain is the pipeline database)
IMMUDB_DB=securesoftwaresupplychain
